Reading: every law-alone rule gets the shape wrong. With QUMOND on, lensing is about 14 times the measured value at L ~ 28 and 0.08 at L ~ 377,
converged from 128^3 to 192^3. WG3's T1tau0 'within x2' and the 'factor 1/2' were artifacts of grading one amplitude.
kappa = 1/2 FITTED; not theory closed; nothing here says the data favour the framework.
